@startuml Filter Class by Academic Year
actor User
participant ": ClassManagementPage " as ClassManagementPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

User->ClassManagementPage: 1. Select Academic Year from dropdown
activate User
activate ClassManagementPage

User->ClassManagementPage: 2. Academic Year selection triggers filter

ClassManagementPage->Router: 3. Send GET /api/classgroup/by-academic-year/{academicYearId}
activate Router
deactivate ClassManagementPage

Router->ClassGroupController: 4. Route Request to Controller
activate ClassGroupController
deactivate Router

ClassGroupController->ClassGroupService: 5. GetClassesByFilterAsync(filter)
activate ClassGroupService
deactivate ClassGroupController

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 6. Query classes by AcademicYearId
activate ClassGroupRepository
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 7. Filter classes in database WHERE AcademicYearId = {id}
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 8. Return filtered classes with relations
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 9. Return classes list
deactivate ClassGroupRepository

alt classes found
    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 10.1 Map to ClassGroupDto[]
    ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 10.1.1 Return class list
    activate ClassGroupController
    

    ClassGroupController-->Router: 10.1.2 Success response
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    Router-->ClassManagementPage: 10.1.3 Return filtered classes
    activate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate Router
    ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 10.1.4 Render class results
    ClassManagementPage-->User: 10.1.5 Display filtered classes
    deactivate ClassManagementPage

else no classes found
    ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 10.2 Return empty list
    activate ClassGroupController
    deactivate ClassGroupService
    ClassGroupController-->Router: 10.2.1 Success response (empty)
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    Router-->ClassManagementPage: 10.2.2 Return empty
    activate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate Router
    ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 10.2.3 Render "No classes found"
    ClassManagementPage-->User: 10.2.4 Display message
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
end

deactivate User
@enduml

